<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Pushing It Down and Praying</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lizzy McAlpine</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Pushing It Down and Praying</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4wO2JlPZw72Xlu6dGUW4Ce</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.610" end="00:20.340">I'm in bed, layin' down, naked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.340" end="00:27.900">He's inside of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.900" end="00:33.530">I love him, kiss his mouth, prayin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.530" end="00:39.400">He can't see what I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.400" end="00:44.850">When I close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.850" end="00:50.480">You replace him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.480" end="00:55.900">Wearin' no disguise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.900" end="01:01.620">You erase him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.620" end="01:05.350">I wanna feel guilty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.350" end="01:09.120">I wanna feel that it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:12.020">I wanna know peace again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.020" end="01:16.500">Wanna sing a different song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.500" end="01:20.170">I want you to need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.170" end="01:23.790">I need to want somethin' more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.790" end="01:25.670">He gives what he can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.670" end="01:33.670">But now I don't know what he's givin' for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.960" end="01:43.760">I'm in bed, layin' down, naked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.760" end="01:51.040">You're inside of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.040" end="01:56.360">I love him, kiss his mouth, sayin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.360" end="02:02.340">"Oh, yeah, baby, touch, and touch, and touch, and touch me"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.340" end="02:05.740">I wanna feel guilty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.740" end="02:09.530">I wanna feel that it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.530" end="02:12.590">I wanna know peace again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.590" end="02:16.910">Wanna sing a different song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.910" end="02:20.610">I want you to need me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.610" end="02:24.140">I need to want somethin' more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.140" end="02:25.990">He gives what he can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.990" end="02:33.970">But now I don't know what he's givin' for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.970" end="02:41.180">Softer, harder, in-between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.180" end="02:48.450">You know just how to get to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.450" end="02:55.740">He is stable, you are deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.740" end="03:03.740">I know just how to get what I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.290" end="03:11.040">I wanna feel guilty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.040" end="03:14.740">I wanna feel that it's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.740" end="03:17.520">I wanna know peace again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.520" end="03:23.990">Wanna be singin' a different song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.990" end="03:27.560">It's only a question</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.560" end="03:31.180">If somebody brings it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.180" end="03:34.380">So I'm pushin' it down and prayin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.380" end="03:40.380">He won't see it when I come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.380" end="03:44.380">I'm pushin' it down and prayin'</p></div></body></tt>